  "scope": "Existing frozen residential and bridge fixtures reused without regeneration for the curved test. True current 3D loopback HTTP and UI with grading, no-side-effect failures, stale control edits, one undo/redo, native batching and save/reopen. Saved native collider and production WorldAuthority capsule checks cover the exterior access, both directions along the curved street continuously across the new junction, and adjacent stone bridge. No avatar renderer, full streaming, arbitrary-input walkability or performance improvement claim. No formal map or scene checkout changes. Q90 lossy VP8 image verified before viewing.",
